{"shortname": "digitalclock4", "name": "Digital Clock 4", "_id": "51c04463ea406b51ad97d17b", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/digitalclock4/", "private": false, "short_description": "Very customizable beautiful clock.\r\n\r\nThere are 2 versions exist (they may co-exist):\r\n- Digital Clock 4 - discontinued, not recommended\r\n- Digital Clock 5 - discontinued, replacement for Digital Clock 4\r\n\r\nDigital Clock 4 final version is 4.7.9\r\nDigital Clock 5 final version is 5.2.2\r\n\r\nNothing special is required to start using this clock. Just launch it and enjoy! When it starts, apart from the clock itself, a small tray icon appears. This tray icon can be used to call the clock configuration dialog. Also this dialog can be called using clock context menu.\r\n\r\nSources (v5) are hosted on GitHub: https://github.com/Kolcha/DigitalClock5\r\n\r\nYou can create your own skin! See this link for details: https://sourceforge.net/p/digitalclock4/wiki/How%20to%20create%20skin/\r\n\r\nNOTE: do NOT download any .rar or .exe files marked as my software, these files are NOT made by me and I'm not responsible for their content", "creation_date": "2013-06-18", "summary": "beautiful customizable clock with plugins", "external_homepage": "https://digitalclock4.sourceforge.io/", "video_url": "www.youtube.com/embed/Q9-T9o3BmyE?rel=0", "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Fediverse"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Instagram"}], "status": "abandoned", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "_url", "preferred_support_url": "https://github.com/Kolcha/DigitalClock5/issues", "developers": [{"username": "nick-korotysh", "name": "Nick Korotysh", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/nick-korotysh/"}], "tools": [{"name": "files-sf", "mount_point": "files", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/digitalclock4/files/", "mount_label": "Files"}, {"name": "summary", "mo